    "title": "Citizens ask council for resolution for voters to decide on districts - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shellie Murdaugh ,\n12 hours ago Jasper County Council was asked by Rev. Donald Sheftall April 20 to consider a resolution to allow voters to decide on one main issue concerning single-member districts. An appeal was made to Jasper County Council during its April 20 meeting requesting to have one question placed on the ballot in time for the Nov. 3 General Election. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
